WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.726
Calabi flow can blow up.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.178
Calabi flow should carry any metric toward

3
00:00:05.178 --> 00:00:07.217
a canonical one. Chen said forever.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.284
Symmetry reduces it to one variable, which pinches to a point.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.539
Claimed: a finite time singularity, in ten dimensions.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.844
Not in Lean.
